      "pluginVersion": "12.3.3",
      "description": "The same files as the panel above, with their full path, and filtered by the **Folder** dropdown.\n\nWritten periodically by `disk-usage-metrics.sh`, so a file deleted moments ago can still appear here\nuntil the next run.\n\nOne line per inode: the *arrs hardlink on import, so a grabbed file and its library copy are the same\nbytes under two paths. Counting both would double the footer total."
